// # Phys Classical -- Classical Mechanics, Fluids, Thermo, Rigid/Soft Body
//
// Logline: Classical mechanics, fluid dynamics, thermodynamics, rigid/soft body simulation, collisions. Phase 3.4 reorg: merged from phys/continuum/, phys/mechanics/, phys/hydro/, phys/thermo/, phys/physics/, phys/advanced/, plus the root classical files (conservation_laws, least_action, thermodynamics, phys_invariants).
//
// Setup: Co-located module of 116 files under std/science/phys/classical. Pure compute, no caps.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Conservation and least-action family (3 files).
//   2. Thermo family (carnot, entropy, gibbs, ideal_gas, etc.).
//   3. Continuum family (navier_stokes, cauchy_stress).
//   4. Collision, rigid body, soft body family.
//   5. Compressible flow, boundary layer, airfoil family.
//   6. Lattice Boltzmann, turbulence, RANS/LES family.
//   7. Acoustic wave, reverberation, Doppler family.
//   8. Solar radiation pressure, orbital atmospheric drag family.

